<ResourceDictionary xmlns="https://github.com/avaloniaui"
                    xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml">

  <!--
    A number that also carries a ladder: the typed box, and a caret beside it that opens the
    values worth reaching in one move (api/proto/screenshare/v1/form.proto,
    CONTROL_KIND_NUMBER_SELECT).

    It is two widgets and not one, because the two answer differently: the box takes any
    value the field's range admits, and the ladder takes one of a few. Gluing them is what
    says they write the same setting - a spinner with a dropdown standing off to its right
    reads as two controls, and a reader who saw the ladder would not know the box was the
    same knob.

    Both halves are the plain themes with their inner corners taken off, which is the whole
    of the treatment. Neither restates a template: each inherits its type's own and sets the
    one property that differs, so a change to the number box or the button reaches this pair
    (Design/Inputs.axaml, Design/Buttons.axaml).

    The menu is the product's own (Design/Menus.axaml), carrying the option row's two extra
    setters (Controls/Select), because a list of values to pick from is one thing in this
    product however the closed control beside it is drawn.
  -->

  <!-- The typed half: the design's number box with its trailing corners taken off. -->
  <ControlTheme x:Key="NumberSelectInput" TargetType="NumericUpDown" BasedOn="{StaticResource {x:Type NumericUpDown}}">
    <Setter Property="CornerRadius" Value="{StaticResource RadiusControlLeading}" />
  </ControlTheme>

  <!--
    The ladder half: a caret and nothing else, because the value is already shown in the box
    to its left. A face repeating it would be the same figure twice, and the two would
    disagree the moment one was typed into.

    The negative margin is the join. Both halves carry a 1px border, and without it the pair
    shows a 2px seam where they meet.
  -->
  <ControlTheme x:Key="NumberSelectCaret" TargetType="Button" BasedOn="{StaticResource {x:Type Button}}">
    <Setter Property="CornerRadius" Value="{StaticResource RadiusControlTrailing}" />
    <Setter Property="Padding" Value="7,0" />
    <Setter Property="Margin" Value="-1,0,0,0" />
  </ControlTheme>

</ResourceDictionary>
